description:
V25 · Panel, status first. Same as V22, but the session's Customizations panel leads with what needs you:
- a context strip (repo · agent · environment) with a toolbar;
- sign-in and error notifications with buttons at the top;
- quiet uppercase section labels;
- two-line rows (name, then source and state) with an always-visible switch and a More Actions button;
- a plugin expands to show what it brings.
